# The Phase 4 pilot is an upstream checkout of yandex-research/rtdl-revisiting-models
# (commit e3ed46ca, ~13 MB). It is evidence, not our source, so it is not re-vendored here.
# The two files inside it that ARE ours stay tracked; see phase4/PILOT_CHECKOUT.md to rebuild.
phase4/rtdl-revisiting-models/*
!phase4/rtdl-revisiting-models/result-doctor.yml
!phase4/rtdl-revisiting-models/EVIDENCE_NOTES.md

